    {
      "source": "Unlike <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/ImportSelector.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>ImportSelector</code></a> and <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/ImportBeanDefinitionRegistrar.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>ImportBeanDefinitionRegistrar</code></a> any\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/Aware.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>Aware</code></a> callbacks will not be invoked before this method is called.",
      "translation": "与<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/ImportSelector.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>ImportSelector</code></a>和<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/ImportBeanDefinitionRegistrar.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>ImportBeanDefinitionRegistrar</code></a>不同，任何\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/Aware.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>Aware</code></a>回调都不会在此方法调用之前被触发。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Using <a href=\"DeterminableImports.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.context.annotation\"><code>DeterminableImports</code></a> is particularly useful when working with Spring's\ntesting support. It allows for better generation of <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a> cache\nkeys.",
      "translation": "使用 <a href=\"DeterminableImports.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.context.annotation\"><code>DeterminableImports</code></a> 在处理 Spring 的测试支持时特别有用。它允许更好地生成 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a> 缓存键。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Imports from multiple <a href=\"DeterminableImports.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.context.annotation\"><code>DeterminableImports</code></a> instances may be combined by the\ncaller to create a complete set.",
      "translation": "来自多个 <a href=\"DeterminableImports.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.context.annotation\"><code>DeterminableImports</code></a> 实例的导入可以由调用者合并以创建一个完整的集合。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>metadata</code> - the source meta-data",
      "translation": "<code>metadata</code> - 源元数据",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "a key representing the annotations that actually drive the import",
      "translation": "代表实际驱动导入的注解的关键字",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return a set of objects that represent the imports.",
      "translation": "返回一个表示导入的对象的集合。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This is a functional interface and can therefore be used as the assignment target for a lambda expression or method reference.",
